#: ../../benchmark/benchmark.md:1
msgid "RTP-LLM Unified Performance Benchmark"
msgstr ""

#: ../../benchmark/benchmark.md:3
msgid ""
"Use `tools/perf_test` for local, SSH and AOne model-level prefill/decode tests. Each run takes "
"one strict JSON config. Declare the model, topology, engine, workload and output in that file. "
"Mode is inferred from `workload.kind`; action is `run` for a config and `report` for an existing "
"run directory. Explicit `--mode` remains an assertion and must agree with the workload."
msgstr ""

